    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Watch out for Uncountable Nouns commonly mistaken for Countable Nouns in error spotting questions.",
        "Pay attention to the 'One Of' rule which requires a plural noun followed by a singular verb.",
        "Differentiate correctly between 'A Number Of' (takes plural verb) and 'The Number Of' (takes singular verb).",
        "Foreign plurals and nouns that look plural but take singular verbs (e.g., subjects, diseases) are frequent SSC question targets."
      ],
      "id": "nnzkvau"
